file:line. For each call site say whether it is (a) a real scene/zone change or (b) an in-place 
reload with a live GameNetwork session. Then answer: is there any state available AT THE unload() 
CALL SITE, or reachable from inside unload(), that reliably distinguishes those two cases? Name the 
exact symbol. Finally: does anything else in the codebase DEPEND on cell teardown cascade-deleting 
cell contents (i.e. would suppressing that cascade leak objects or break an invariant)? Cite 
file:line.

